  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to health facility and shelters in L&#x2019;viv Oblast for IDPs fleeing the conflict in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Main goal: provide temporary shelter, protection activities and healthcare to IDP fleeing the conflict in Eastern and Central Ukraine and host communities in the city of Lviv, Ukraine.Objectives: 18.000 IDPs fleeing Eastern and Central Ukraine are in safe and secured environments while transiting in Lviv, provided with primary health care support, advice and information, and food security while L&#x2019;viv host communities are also supported through strengthen health services.</narrative>
  </description>
