    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator 1.2:  fully equipped and functioning transit centres with basic medical screening point and protection information and monitoring are operational.</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The shelters to be identified will be quickly equipped to receive the refugees in good conditions (registration area, medical corner, kitchen, dormitories).</narrative>
